        "content": "<p>This just in: [configbaker] Docker image for gdcc/configbaker:6.12-noble is missing <a href=\"https://github.com/IQSS/dataverse/issues/12761\">#12761</a></p>",
        "id": 628418968,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin 🚀",
        "timestamp": 1790869064
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>We need to disable the Maven Smallrye plugin when building the configbaker image. The main classes built is skipped, too, so Smallrye can't find it. Not sure what change between 6.11 and 6.12, but here we are.</p>",
        "id": 628432901,
        "sender_full_name": "Oliver Bertuch",
        "timestamp": 1790872144
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The culprit is 1a405abf, which added a filter reference. That's why this worked in 6.11 and before. It's a change introduced in 6.12</p>",
        "id": 628488262,
        "sender_full_name": "Oliver Bertuch",
        "timestamp": 1790886856
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/IQSS/dataverse/commit/1a405abf\">https://github.com/IQSS/dataverse/commit/1a405abf</a> from <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"602497\">@Balázs Pataki</span> in <a href=\"https://github.com/IQSS/dataverse/issues/12439\">#12439</a>.</p>",
